---
import StoicLayout from '../../layouts/StoicLayout.astro';
---
<StoicLayout
  title="Everyday Stoic — daily Stoic wisdom on your home screen"
  description="A new piece of Stoic wisdom, every day of the year — in the app or right on your home screen. Free."
>
  <main class="shell">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">iPhone · Free</p>
        <h1>A new piece of Stoic wisdom,<br /><em>every day of the year.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Open the app for a quiet moment of reflection, or keep the day&rsquo;s quote right
          on your home screen. One idea, chosen for you, from the philosophers who have
          steadied minds for two thousand years.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-shot">
        <img src="/everyday-stoic/screen-quotes.png" alt="Everyday Stoic quote of the day" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
      <article class="feature">
        <h2>One quote a day, all year</h2>
        <p>
          A different reflection each day, drawn from Marcus Aurelius, Seneca, Epictetus and
          more. Every quote is shown before any repeats, so the year unfolds one idea at a time.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature">
        <h2>Right on your home screen</h2>
        <p>
          Add the widget and the day&rsquo;s wisdom is there whenever you glance at your phone.
          Light and dark styles, so it always sits naturally with your home screen.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature">
        <h2>Meet the minds who lived it</h2>
        <p>
          Read short portraits of the great Stoics, each with original artwork and the story of
          how they turned philosophy into a way of living.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature">
        <h2>Calm by design</h2>
        <p>
          No accounts, no notifications you didn&rsquo;t ask for, no clutter. Just a beautiful,
          unhurried space to think for a minute a day.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="widget-band">
      <div class="widget-shot">
        <img src="/everyday-stoic/screen-widget.png" alt="Everyday Stoic home screen widget" />
      </div>
      <div class="widget-copy">
        <h2>Wisdom where you&rsquo;ll actually see it</h2>
        <p>
          The widget updates itself each morning. No opening required. The day&rsquo;s Stoic
          quote is simply waiting for you on the home screen, in the size and style you prefer.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="free">
      <p class="kicker">Free</p>
      <h2>Free, because that is the Stoic way.</h2>
      <p>
        The Stoics believed we are made for one another, and that helping others is helping
        ourselves. Everyday Stoic is free for exactly that reason. The more people who carry a
        little Stoic calm and clarity into the world, the better that world is for all of us.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="note">
      <blockquote>
        <p>
          Thank you for using Everyday Stoic, and for taking the time to learn a little Stoic
          philosophy. I hope it brings you a moment of steadiness each day.
        </p>
        <footer>Mikhail</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>
  </main>
</StoicLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 48px;
    align-items: center; padding: 72px 0 40px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.9rem); line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  .hero h1 em { color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; }
  .lede {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.4vw, 1.42rem); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 24px;
    max-width: 30ch;
  }
  .hero-shot { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .hero-shot img {
    width: 100%; max-width: 300px; height: auto; border-radius: 34px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -28px rgba(42, 38, 34, 0.55);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .features {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2px;
    background: var(--hairline); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .feature { background: var(--surface); padding: 34px 32px; }
  .feature h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.55rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .feature p { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; }

  .widget-band {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr; gap: 48px;
    align-items: center; margin-top: 72px;
  }
  .widget-shot { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .widget-shot img {
    width: 100%; max-width: 280px; height: auto; border-radius: 34px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -28px rgba(42, 38, 34, 0.55);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .widget-copy h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .widget-copy p { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 1.08rem; margin: 0; max-width: 42ch; }

  .free { text-align: center; margin: 96px auto 0; max-width: 640px; }
  .kicker {
    color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .free h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 2.7rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .free p { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 1.12rem; margin: 0; }

  .note { margin: 64px auto 0; max-width: 620px; }
  .note blockquote {
    margin: 0; padding: 34px 36px; background: var(--surface);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .note blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.32rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .note blockquote footer {
    font-family: var(--sans); color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; padding: 48px 0 24px; text-align: center; }
    .hero-copy { order: 1; }
    .hero-shot { order: 2; }
    .lede { max-width: none; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .widget-band { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .widget-copy p { max-width: none; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  }
</style>
